        Built and self-host an autonomous AI assistant engineered with function tool-calling, headless browser automation, and multi-channel messaging integration. Hermes automates personal workflows, executes system tasks, and explores how agentic architectures can systematically reduce repetitive manual toil in IT operations and infrastructure engineering.
      </p>

