        A fast, fully static corporate marketing website for OGGRO Technologies Limited, the Bangladesh arm of Techants Solutions (Australia). Built with Next.js 15, React 19, TypeScript, and Tailwind CSS v4, shipped as zero-runtime static HTML on Apache/WHM with automated Playwright testing.
